# web/run.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the record of the last real run:
# every figure the product surface renders, every MCP call it made, and every
# post-condition with the query that established it. Committing it is what makes the
# README's numbers auditable from the repository instead of taken on trust, and it is
# what puts real evidence on the deployed page's first paint rather than an empty state.

